{
  "_id": "index-land",
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "if people keep commandments, they will prosper in land, 1 Ne. 2:20 (4:14; 14:1–2; 2 Ne. 1:9, 20; Jarom 1:9; Omni 1:6; Ether 2:8–11). this land is choice above all other lands, 1 Ne. 2:20 (2 Ne. 1:5; 3:2; 10:19; Ether 1:38, 42; 2:7, 10, 15; 9:20; 10:28; 13:2). the Lord leadeth away righteous into precious lands, 1 Ne. 17:38. this land is to be land of liberty, 2 Ne. 1:7 (10:11; Mosiah 29:32; Ether 2:12). if iniquity abound, land to be cursed, 2 Ne. 1:7. every man shall flee into his own land, 2 Ne. 23:14 (Isa. 13:14). small neck of land between land northward and land southward, Alma 22:32. Nephites fight to defend their lands, Alma 35:14 (43:47; 48:10). broken rocks found upon all face of land, 3 Ne. 8:18. New Jerusalem to be built upon this land, 3 Ne. 20:22 (21:22–23; Ether 13:4, 8).",
